cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, cite the paper and this release."
title: "esp32s3-int8-transformer: INT8 KV-cache and attention kernels for the ESP32-S3"
abstract: >-
  Firmware, raw measurement logs and analysis scripts for a 260K-parameter
  decoder-only transformer running at batch size one on an ESP32-S3, with the
  key/value cache stored as int8 in external PSRAM and attention mapped onto
  the 128-bit integer SIMD unit. At 512-token context the final build sustains
  166.73 tokens/s, 2.872x the same-tree fp32 single-core baseline.
